      "statusChangeID": null,
      "value": "@{5de9405aea7cc52772fcc359|full_name} Haven't looked at Canny in a while so just saw this. I can confirm I still get the issue even with the current SDK 3.7.5. I'm using the \"AvatarPedestal\" prefab found under Packages > VRCSDK - Worlds > Samples > Prefabs. All I do is create an empty gameobject in the scene and set that as the Placement. Once I load into the world, the pedestal no longer works and has the red ring around it.",
